## Starting context

Repository: `C:/Users/victo/Codex/Go_Nuts_repos`. Working paper: `pnas_report/paper_simple`. See the [first-draft goal/workflow](README.md), [question](../final_research_question.md), [storyline](../paper_storyline.md), [requirements](../project_requirements.md) and [tone guide](../tone_of_voice.md).

H2 compares before-to-after Guardian tone changes for Premier League signings involving players aged 30+ and under 30. Its main sample has 820 signings, including 67 older and 753 younger. The new analysis describes the words in that corpus as a possible brief introduction to the text analysis. It does not replace H2, validate the sentiment instruments or reinstate omitted H2b regressions.

