Use a fresh-context execution agent for producer/fixture runs as required by the [rerun execution contract](../../reruns/h1_2012_13-2024_25/README.md#fresh-context-execution). Verify meaningful selection edge cases on synthetic fixtures: original-row alignment across a removed liveblog, wrong metadata, period/day boundaries, saved per-signing count mismatches, token/type/hapax accounting, stopword denominators and table ranks. Synthetic output belongs only in a clearly labelled QA subtree and is not paper evidence.

For the real run, verify 820 signings/67 older, exact saved per-signing/period counts, selected input hashes, rank order, summed raw counts, relative frequencies summing to one within each stream and list/count/summary consistency. Render and inspect actual plot exports at intended width, including grayscale; verify font embedding, vector content and readable linear axes. No sentiment scoring, article fetching, shuffles or transfer/network rerun is part of this task.

